# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env or .env.local.
# Vite inlines these at BUILD time: set them in your host's dashboard, then redeploy.

# REQUIRED. Origin of the backend API, no trailing slash.
#   Local backend : http://localhost:8000
#   Production    : https://api.example.com
#   No backend    : demo   (sample data + in-browser scoring; /predict disabled)
#                   Use this until the backend is hosted, then swap in its origin and redeploy.
# If this is missing the app shows a configuration error screen instead of loading.
# The backend must send CORS headers allowing this app's origin (see README).
VITE_API_URL=
